  body: |
    # Industrial Injuries claims and export as separate questions

    ## Authored interpretation

    The Industrial Injuries section treats claims from outside Great Britain and export of an existing benefit as separate topics, each with domestic, EC or reciprocal-agreement provisions.

    ## Scope and boundaries

    DMG 074361 is a substantive scope statement, not sufficient evidence of export entitlement. Detailed conditions, treaty coverage and legal currency remain unresolved.

    ## Inspected source passages

    - [DMG 074361, PDF page 91](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/692421b6367485ea116a55db/dmg-ch-07-part-04.pdf#page=91)
    - [DMG 074362, PDF page 91](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/692421b6367485ea116a55db/dmg-ch-07-part-04.pdf#page=91)

